        "text_faVBT6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Peanut butter isn’t just tasty, it’s also a natural source of protein, healthy fats, and vitamins. When choosing peanut butter for your dog, always ensure it is xylitol-free (as xylitol is toxic to dogs) and unsweetened.</p><p>Peanut butter provides energy, supports muscle health, and makes an ideal snack for both active pups and senior dogs who need extra nourishment.</p>"
